    <description>The Meteorological Service has issued a Thunderstorm Advisory for western.

Be aware that thunderstorms may occur. Take extra care in exposed areas, like open terrain.

Localized flash floods may occur, blocking roads that cross river beds and drainage channels. Drains and gullies may overflow.

Lightning may kill or injure people and animals. Stay indoors away from windows. Do not shelter under trees.

Stay informed.</description>
